sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Main as 主 Agent
    participant Host as ACP 会话服务
    participant Runner as 外部 Agent
    Runner->>Host: 请求权限，提供选项 ID
    Host-->>Main: 返回 permission_required，外部任务继续等待
    Main-->>User: 询问是否保存演示简报
    User->>Main: 仅这次允许
    Main->>Host: respond，message 为 allow-report
    Host-->>Runner: 回复原权限请求，选中 allow-report
    Runner-->>Host: 同一次任务继续并结束
